---
title: "Idea to merged: the skill pipeline"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: exec
    lg1: done
    lg2: Breaks NoDoubleWork or NoSleepingFrontier in some cases
    lg3: Path to the NoDoubleWork or NoSleepingFrontier bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 pink
  class lg2 mayBreak
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Tickets ready, maestro asleep
  s1: implement-spec running on an integration branch
  s2: bcheck working a ticket
  s3: Maestro dispatching
  s4: Integration PR waiting for you
  s5: bcheck planning with you
  s6: A worker is running
  s7: Last ticket merged, closing out
  s8: Tickets filed
  s9: needs-help: waiting on the master
  s10: bcheck's full-send is asking you
  s11: Merged
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you run implement-spec
  s0 --> s2: you run bcheck and it claims a ticket
  s0 --> s3: someone nudges the maestro
  s1 --> s1: you run bcheck and it claims a ticket
  s1 --> s4: implement-spec marks the PR ready
  s2 --> s2: bcheck judges it ready or bcheck implements and hands over to full-send or someone nudges the maestro or maestro finds nothing to do and pauses its heartbeat
  s2 --> s5: bcheck judges it needs planning
  s3 --> s1: you run implement-spec
  s3 --> s2: you run bcheck and it claims a ticket
  s3 --> s6: maestro claims a ticket and starts a worker
  s4 --> s7: you merge the integration PR or maestro closes the epic, every sub-issue is closed
  s6 --> s8: worker merges the PR
  s6 --> s9: worker labels needs-help
  s5 --> s2: you approve the plan
  s2 --> s10: full-send asks the user
  s2 --> s8: full-send merges the PR and closes the issue
  s7 --> s11: every ticket is merged
  s8 --> s7: maestro closes the epic, every sub-issue is closed
  s1 --> s7: maestro closes the epic, every sub-issue is closed
  s10 --> s2: you answer full-send
  s9 --> s1: you run implement-spec
  s9 --> s8: master finishes the ticket by hand
  s9 --> s3: master removes needs-help
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 mayBreak
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s4 teal
  class s4 mayBreak
  class s5 teal
  class s6 teal
  class s7 teal
  class s8 teal
  class s8 mayBreak
  class s8 bugPath
  class s9 teal
  class s10 teal
  class s11 pink
